  "details": "No idea how this happens, but the mouse cursor (the weird/cool plasma effect) in menus stops working as soon as I load into the game, however the trail for moving the cursor quickly will appear and options that highlight will get highlighted. I've tried the Alt+Tab method to fix this, it worked on the first try but crashed the game, and since it hasn't been working at all.\n\n-IMPORTANT UPDATE(?)-\nIt just fixed itself when I loaded into a world. No idea why. Also don't know if this fix is permanent or not, and if this bug is limited to the hub or not. Further testing is required...",
